# .kiro/ and .jules/ are deliberately NOT ignored. They hold the Windows voice
# assistant specification (requirements, design, tasks) and prior session
# findings — 60K of design.md alone. Ignoring them staged 30,377 deletions
# while the files stayed on disk, so a commit would have erased the specs from
# history while everything still looked present locally.

